        <div class={TL_DONE}><span class={TL_VER}>v0.3</span><h4 class={TL_H4}>One-line shell installer</h4><p class={TL_P}>Release-asset binaries, checksum-verified <code class="font-mono">install.sh</code> / <code class="font-mono">.ps1</code>.</p></div>
