        <div class={TL}><span class={TL_VER}>later</span><h4 class={TL_H4}>OS-level sandboxing</h4><p class={TL_P}>Repo-only filesystem, network off by default for every dispatch runner.</p></div>
        <div class={TL}><span class={TL_VER}>later</span><h4 class={TL_H4}>Repository memory</h4><p class={TL_P}>Learn repo conventions and prior decisions — local, under your control.</p></div>
